  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.0 — New high-level API and data types.\n      - WriteDate / WriteBool for date and boolean cells\n      - WriteRow(...) with automatic type detection\n      - WriteRecords<T> object export with [ExcelColumn] / [ExcelIgnore]\n      - Raised column (16384) and sheet (1000) limits\n      - Updated SharpCompress to 0.49.1 (security fix)",
